# Play test of Stormwing Isle (CIPlay stormwing_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'): a flying island (45 m up; heights count
# from the island's own water line). No quest: along the strip to the crashed plane and the pilot's chest, the hangar
# and its crate and barrel, into the cave to the pilots' stores, the buried tin. Points as in its recipe.
island Stormwing Isle
offset 0 0
wait 3
at -27 -6
expect height 9
read Sign at the strip
walk -11 -6 to 0 -6 to 14 -6 to 26 -6 h=9
read The flight log
open Pilot's chest
walk -20 2 to -20 10 to -18 16 h=9
open Hangar crate
open Barrel in the hangar
walk 11 -6 to 11 0 to 11 6 to 10 10 h=9.5 below=12
expect stand 10 10 h=9.4 below=12
open The pilots' stores
dig
